# Convex. The system of record. Dev and production are two deployments.
# Do not guess a team. Set these after the Convex project exists.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_CONVEX_URL=
# CLERK_JWT_ISSUER_DOMAIN is set on the Convex deployment, not in the client.
#
# Clerk. The publishable key may ship to the browser. The secret key must not.
# In Clerk token settings, add a boolean claim named secondFactor from the
# user's two-factor enrollment. Do not send that claim from client code.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_CLERK_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=
# CLERK_SECRET_KEY=

# Public site. Production uses https://vistrial.io when NODE_ENV is production.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=http://localhost:3000

# Optional marketing integrations. Blank is fine for local development.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_GA_MEASUREMENT_ID=
# NEXT_PUBLIC_META_PIXEL_ID=
# NEXT_PUBLIC_TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY=
# TURNSTILE_SECRET_KEY=
# NEXT_PUBLIC_AUDIT_BOOKING_WIDGET_SRC=
# NEXT_PUBLIC_AUDIT_BOOKING_EMBED_SCRIPT=
# NEXT_PUBLIC_GHL_MARKETPLACE_URL=
# AUDIT_GHL_WEBHOOK_URL=
# MARKETING_EVENTS_WEBHOOK_URL=
